"act":{"word":"act","order":["on","as","up","out"],"keys":{"on":[{"text":"The police acted on a tip from a neighbor.","zh":"警方根据一位邻居提供的线索采取了行动。"},{"text":"This medicine acts on the nervous system.","zh":"这种药作用于神经系统。"}],"as":[{"text":"A large tree acted as a shelter from the rain.","zh":"一棵大树成了躲雨的地方。"},{"text":"She will act as our guide during the trip.","zh":"旅途中她将担任我们的导游。"}],"up":[{"text":"My old laptop is acting up again.","zh":"我的旧笔记本电脑又出毛病了。"},{"text":"The kids always act up when they are tired.","zh":"孩子们一累就开始闹。"}],"out":[{"text":"The children acted out a scene from the story.","zh":"孩子们把故事中的一个场景表演了出来。"},{"text":"Some teenagers act out when they feel ignored.","zh":"有些青少年觉得被忽视时就会做出过激行为。"}]},"x":{"zipf":5.3,"senses":{"on":[{"zh":"按照……行事；对……起作用","kind":"preposition","examples":[0,1]}],"as":[{"zh":"充当；担任","kind":"preposition","examples":[0,1]}],"up":[{"zh":"捣乱；（机器）出毛病","kind":"particle","examples":[0,1]}],"out":[{"zh":"表演出来；（因情绪）做出不良举动","kind":"particle","examples":[0,1]}]}}},
