"comment":{"word":"comment","order":["on"],"keys":{"on":[{"text":"The minister refused to comment on the rumors.","zh":"部长拒绝对传言发表评论。"},{"text":"Several readers commented on the article.","zh":"好几位读者对这篇文章发表了评论。"},{"text":"Could you comment on my draft?","zh":"你能给我的草稿提点意见吗？"}]},"x":{"zipf":4.88,"senses":{"on":[{"zh":"对……发表评论","kind":"preposition","examples":[0,1,2]}]}}},
